#. module: ugess_membership
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ugess_membership.field_membership_invoice__expenditure_ceiling_first_period
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ugess_membership.field_membership_membership_line__expenditure_ceiling_first_period
msgid ""
"\n"
"    This amount corresponds to the amount defined for the first period.\n"
"\n"
"    For example, if the interval is monthly and the membership starts on "
"07/09,\n"
"    the amount of this first period should be the amount defined in the\n"
"    expenditure ceiling field divided by the number of days in the month "
"and\n"
"    multiplied by the number of days between the start date and the date "
"defined\n"
"    in the end date field of the first period.\n"
"\n"
"    This field is not calculated automatically.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"     Ce montant correspond au montant défini pour la première période.\n"
"\n"
"    Par exemple, si l'intervalle est mensuel et que l'adhésion débute le "
"07/09,\n"
"    le montant de cette première période doit correspondre au montant défini "
"dans le\n"
"    champ plafond de dépenses divisé par le nombre de jours du mois et \n"
"    multipliée par le nombre de jours compris entre la date de début et la "
"date définie\n"
"    dans le champ de la date de fin de la première période.\n"
"\n"
"    Ce champ n'est pas calculé automatiquement.\n"
"    "

#. module: ugess_membership
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ugess_membership.field_membership_invoice__expenditure_ceiling
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ugess_membership.field_membership_membership_line__expenditure_ceiling
msgid ""
"\n"
"    This amount represents the maximum amount that can be spent over the "
"period\n"
"    given in the expenditure ceiling period field.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Ce montant représente le montant maximum qui peut être dépensé au cours "
"de la période\n"
"    indiquée dans le champ de la période de plafond des dépenses.\n"
"    "

#. module: ugess_membership
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ugess_membership.field_membership_invoice__expenditure_ceiling_first_period_end_date
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ugess_membership.field_membership_invoice_override__membership_line_first_period_end_date
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ugess_membership.field_membership_membership_line__expenditure_ceiling_first_period_end_date
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ugess_membership.field_membership_membership_line_expenditure_override__membership_line_first_period_end_date
msgid ""
"\n"
"    This date is used to define the end of the first period if it does not "
"start\n"
"    at the beginning of an interval (beginning of a week, a month, a year).\n"
"\n"
"    For example if the interval is monthly and the membership starts on "
"7/09,\n"
"    the end of the first period will be 30/09.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Cette date est utilisée pour définir la fin de la première période si "
"elle ne commence pas\n"
"     au début d'un intervalle (début de la semaine, du mois, de l'année).\n"
"\n"
"    Par exemple si l'intervalle est mensuel et que l'adhésion commence le "
"7/09,\n"
"    la fin de la première période sera le 30/09.\n"
"    "

#. module: ugess_membership
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ugess_membership.field_membership_invoice__expenditure_ceiling_period
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ugess_membership.field_membership_invoice_override__expenditure_ceiling_period
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ugess_membership.field_membership_membership_line__expenditure_ceiling_period
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ugess_membership.field_membership_membership_line_expenditure_override__expenditure_ceiling_period
msgid ""
"\n"
"    This interval represents the period for which the expenditure ceiling "
"is\n"
"    defined.\n"
"\n"
"    - Each week starts on a Monday.\n"
"    - Each month starts on its first day.\n"
"    - Each year starts on its first day.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Cet intervalle représente la période pour laquelle le plafond des "
"dépenses est\n"
"    défini.\n"
"\n"
"    - Chaque semaine commence un lundi.\n"
"    - Chaque mois commence le premier jour.\n"
"    - L'année commence le premier jour.\n"
"    "

